From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tyn <tyn@localhost>
Date: Wed, 18 Nov 2026 13:41:44 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] tyn: add an experimental sg-pc profile for STEINS;GATE
 (Steam)

WIP, TYN-only. The Steam release (2016, Game.exe + USRDIR/*.mpk) is the same engine generation as the
Chaos;Child PC profile: ScrWork indices match (the startup script drives the fade mask through
GlobalVars 4400/4401/4402 = SW_MASK1COLOR/ALPHA/PRI), the font sheet is the same 3072x6000 grid, and
most opcodes have the CC shapes. Start from the cc profile: archives become USRDIR/*.mpk mounts,
StartScript is 2 (_STARTUP_WIN.SCX), InstructionSet stays CC for now, and the profile is registered in
gamedefinitions.lua as hidden "sg-pc".

The UI sheets still describe Chaos;Child and are not valid for this game; this commit exists to get the
virtual machine running on real data and to iterate on the profile from there.

